# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# /particuliers/recharge-domicile/ is the route named in the build brief. The page it describes already
# exists at /services/recharge-domicile/, is live, and is indexed. Publishing a second copy would split
# ranking between two URLs and give the site two pages to keep in step; moving the page would break every
# inbound link to the existing URL. A 301 satisfies the route without doing either.
/particuliers/recharge-domicile/  /services/recharge-domicile/  301
/particuliers/recharge-domicile   /services/recharge-domicile/  301
